WEBVTT

00:00:00.980 --> 00:00:05.760
<i>We look the same, but men call us monsters.</i>

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:09.020
<i>If we shadows, which lurk between eras,</i>

00:00:09.020 --> 00:00:11.470
<i>are destined to die,</i>

00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:14.470
<i>then I shall fall with the cherry blossoms.</i>

00:00:14.470 --> 00:00:17.610
<i>Then, I shall fall with the cherry blossoms.</i>

00:01:49.540 --> 00:01:58.050
<b>Tenth Year of the Tenshou Era, 1582 AD 
June 2 by the Old Calendar</b>

00:01:54.090 --> 00:01:58.050
<b>
Honnouji</b>

00:01:58.650 --> 00:02:02.050
<i>Fifty years of a man's life</i>

00:02:03.150 --> 00:02:14.660
<i>are like a dream, compared to the heavens...</i>

00:02:15.360 --> 00:02:27.250
<i>Once a man is born, must he not die?</i>

00:02:28.010 --> 00:02:29.740
Indeed, he must...

00:02:30.630 --> 00:02:32.750
Kazusanosuke-sama.

00:02:33.530 --> 00:02:35.000
Nobunaga-sama.

00:02:36.070 --> 00:02:37.400
Who's there?

00:02:37.860 --> 00:02:39.600
Have you come to take me to hell?

00:02:40.450 --> 00:02:41.850
There's no need to hurry.

00:02:43.040 --> 00:02:45.760
Does it not frustrate you?

00:02:46.500 --> 00:02:47.560
What?

00:02:47.560 --> 00:02:53.950
Does dying with your great desire 
unfulfilled not frustrate you?

00:02:53.950 --> 00:02:56.030
That is my destiny.

00:02:56.460 --> 00:03:00.660
And if it were possible
to change that destiny?

00:03:01.120 --> 00:03:02.240
What?

00:03:02.240 --> 00:03:08.930
You need but ask,
and I shall change it for you.

00:03:37.360 --> 00:03:42.320
<b><i>The Cherry Blossoms Have Fallen</i></b>

00:03:42.880 --> 00:03:46.180
<i>Iemitsu, the third shogun of the Tokugawa.</i>

00:03:46.180 --> 00:03:51.650
<i>He and his brother Tadanaga shared 
an animosity still spoken of today.</i>

00:03:52.260 --> 00:03:55.860
<i>But in the shadows of the struggle for 
succession, which began their feud,</i>

00:03:56.380 --> 00:04:02.330
<i>the Iga and Kouga ninja were 
forced to fight and die.</i>

00:04:02.970 --> 00:04:06.840
<i>Those occurrences, however, 
were buried in darkness,</i>

00:04:06.840 --> 00:04:09.350
<i>and no one knows for sure if 
they ever really happened.</i>

00:04:09.850 --> 00:04:16.110
<b>Third Year of the Kan'ei Era, 1626 AD 
Land of Suruga 

00:04:10.540 --> 00:04:17.270
<i>They left us only animosity,
hatred, and blood...</i>

00:04:18.550 --> 00:04:19.670
Open the gate!

00:04:25.860 --> 00:04:29.270
Shut the gate! Close it up!

00:04:32.660 --> 00:04:35.260
My lord... Tadanaga-sama,

00:04:35.260 --> 00:04:38.570
please, please take all care.

00:04:38.970 --> 00:04:45.060
But even if the last shogun's wife 
is dying, the way he panicked...

00:04:45.390 --> 00:04:47.200
I understand the reason.

00:04:47.200 --> 00:04:51.460
Our lord's only ally at Edo Castle

00:04:51.460 --> 00:04:56.860
was his mother, the last shogun's wife.

00:05:04.470 --> 00:05:07.910
Mother... Please... Please, hang in there.

00:05:07.910 --> 00:05:10.530
I, Tadanaga, am on my way!

00:05:14.710 --> 00:05:21.670
<b>Land of Kii 
Takano Mountain 
Jison'in Village</b>

00:08:26.070 --> 00:08:28.090
It's useless...

00:08:28.090 --> 00:08:30.320
Your illusions can't fool me.

00:08:34.220 --> 00:08:37.320
My eyeballs are up there.

00:08:38.720 --> 00:08:40.430
Give up?

00:08:40.430 --> 00:08:42.830
If you give up, say so.

00:08:43.600 --> 00:08:46.210
Otherwise, I'll snap your arm.

00:08:46.690 --> 00:08:48.490
Hell, no...

00:08:48.490 --> 00:08:52.840
An Iga ninja would rather rip her tongue 
out than concede to a Kouga ninja.

00:08:53.360 --> 00:08:56.760
Guess it's true that Iga ninja never shut up.

00:08:57.230 --> 00:09:01.950
They say it was actually the 
Kouga who won that war.

00:09:01.950 --> 00:09:05.630
Then you Iga lied to make everyone think...

00:09:05.630 --> 00:09:08.240
No one says that.

00:09:08.240 --> 00:09:11.140
You Kouga are pathetic.

00:09:12.090 --> 00:09:14.860
Still refuse to admit you lost?

00:09:25.760 --> 00:09:27.370
That's what you get.

00:09:38.540 --> 00:09:40.650
Iga bitch!

00:09:41.410 --> 00:09:42.740
Sorry.

00:09:44.200 --> 00:09:46.440
I'm an Iga bitch, too.

00:09:47.370 --> 00:09:48.690
Namenba...

00:09:52.040 --> 00:09:53.680
This is your punishment.

00:09:54.200 --> 00:09:57.000
For continuing to go on
about the Iga and Kouga.

00:10:02.600 --> 00:10:04.250
I win again.

00:10:04.250 --> 00:10:06.130
It's boring...

00:10:06.130 --> 00:10:07.920
Too easy.

00:10:25.040 --> 00:10:25.810
No.

00:10:31.000 --> 00:10:34.320
This isn't the sound I want to hear.

00:10:34.740 --> 00:10:36.480
Kazuma-sama?

00:10:36.480 --> 00:10:39.320
He's always so damn into what he's doing.

00:10:39.750 --> 00:10:41.570
Maybe I'll play with him a little.

00:10:56.420 --> 00:10:58.080
Don't struggle.

00:10:58.080 --> 00:11:00.960
Struggle any more,
and your head will go flying.

00:11:00.960 --> 00:11:02.970
Or do you wish to hear

00:11:02.970 --> 00:11:07.620
the rare sound that comes from 
heaven's lyre when you die?

00:11:10.100 --> 00:11:11.930
Kazuma-sama, please stop.

00:11:11.930 --> 00:11:13.630
I don't know what happened,

00:11:13.630 --> 00:11:15.290
but please forgive her!

00:11:15.290 --> 00:11:16.630
No.

00:11:16.630 --> 00:11:20.110
They underestimate what
it means to be a ninja.

00:11:20.410 --> 00:11:22.290
They make a mockery of it.

00:11:22.290 --> 00:11:23.170
They're still...

00:11:23.170 --> 00:11:24.870
They're still children.

00:11:25.260 --> 00:11:27.180
And that is why...

00:11:27.180 --> 00:11:31.960
Unless they truly suffer, at least once, 
they won't change their ways.

00:11:32.680 --> 00:11:35.460
Unless they see the blood of 
their companions, that is.

00:11:56.720 --> 00:11:58.730
Knock it off!

00:11:59.260 --> 00:12:00.610
Hachirou...

00:12:01.000 --> 00:12:02.110
That's enough.

00:12:08.320 --> 00:12:09.370
Wh-What?

00:12:09.720 --> 00:12:12.620
What are you scared of, Kazuma?

00:12:12.620 --> 00:12:17.630
You aren't going to try and 
fight our leader, are you?

00:12:18.140 --> 00:12:20.040
You jest, Gei'in-dono.

00:12:20.040 --> 00:12:21.130
Why would I?

00:12:21.620 --> 00:12:27.460
You haven't forgotten how terrifying 
Hachirou's eye magic can be, have you?

00:12:27.460 --> 00:12:30.320
Forgive him, Hachirou-dono.

00:12:30.320 --> 00:12:33.140
He means nothing by it.

00:12:33.450 --> 00:12:37.120
Strengthening his skills is the 
only thing he's interested in.

00:12:37.120 --> 00:12:40.270
And that single-minded
nature is his single flaw.

00:12:40.900 --> 00:12:42.600
I know that, Gei'in.

00:12:47.790 --> 00:12:50.360
Our leader is a handful, is he not?

00:12:50.940 --> 00:12:55.170
He does nothing but play with those 
whose skills are not yet fully formed.

00:12:55.170 --> 00:12:58.080
Don't say that, Tenshin. Kasou.

00:12:58.080 --> 00:13:02.460
He is still a child.

00:13:02.460 --> 00:13:05.180
More importantly, those two...

00:13:05.490 --> 00:13:06.530
Those two?

00:13:06.930 --> 00:13:11.930
The blood that flows within Hachirou and 
Hibiki must not be allowed to perish.

00:13:11.930 --> 00:13:15.940
They must do it,
whether they like it or not.

00:13:16.380 --> 00:13:19.440
You would have a brother bed his sister?

00:13:19.750 --> 00:13:21.690
You should know better than to even ask.

00:13:22.050 --> 00:13:24.360
Not merely brother and sister.

00:13:24.360 --> 00:13:27.850
To keep the bloodline alive, we would 
force a parent to bed a child.

00:13:28.560 --> 00:13:34.070
Without superior ninja, 
both Kouga and Iga are finished.

00:13:35.110 --> 00:13:40.450
Hachirou and Hibiki should
both be aware of this.

00:13:48.210 --> 00:13:49.380
What is this?

00:13:50.230 --> 00:13:53.670
The wife of the last shogun is unwell.

00:13:53.670 --> 00:13:55.730
Suruga-sama's mother?

00:13:56.630 --> 00:13:59.280
It says that he left last night.

00:14:24.170 --> 00:14:26.380
My lord! It really is dangerous!

00:14:26.380 --> 00:14:28.010
Please stop!

00:14:28.010 --> 00:14:30.880
I said that I don't care!

00:14:30.880 --> 00:14:33.100
Even if I'm struck by lightning,

00:14:33.100 --> 00:14:36.520
I must... I must go!

00:15:00.830 --> 00:15:02.120
Hachirou!

00:15:05.540 --> 00:15:06.460
Your sandals.

00:15:07.500 --> 00:15:09.010
Aren't you cold?

00:15:09.010 --> 00:15:10.550
I'm fine!

00:15:13.250 --> 00:15:14.530
A cherry blossom?

00:15:16.340 --> 00:15:19.000
I just cut a branch off of
the Tenzen cherry tree.

00:15:19.370 --> 00:15:20.310
That's awful!

00:15:20.690 --> 00:15:23.360
A branch or two won't hurt it.

00:15:23.360 --> 00:15:26.190
The Tenzen cherry tree is immortal.

00:15:26.430 --> 00:15:28.190
That's just an old legend...

00:15:28.950 --> 00:15:33.950
They say that one of those dirt mounds
belongs to Yakushiji Tenzen-sama.

00:15:33.950 --> 00:15:37.130
An immortal ninja wouldn't have a grave.

00:15:38.700 --> 00:15:39.700
Maybe not.

00:15:42.830 --> 00:15:44.210
Gorone, you're in there, right?

00:15:44.470 --> 00:15:45.480
I'm coming in.

00:15:57.790 --> 00:15:59.480
Is that Shikibu's?

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:01.180
Yes.

00:16:01.180 --> 00:16:02.980
I'm tinkering with his Saibougu.

00:16:04.540 --> 00:16:07.980
She asked if you could fire off 
multiple rounds at once.

00:16:08.660 --> 00:16:10.180
Multiple rounds at once?

00:16:10.180 --> 00:16:14.000
She said it takes too long between 
firing one round and the next.

00:16:14.940 --> 00:16:17.240
Hachisu asks for some crazy stuff...

00:16:18.010 --> 00:16:22.030
Have you seen what's been going on 
between Hachirou and Hibiki lately?

00:16:22.030 --> 00:16:24.000
You seem happy.

00:16:25.490 --> 00:16:27.820
Of course. It's wonderful.

00:16:27.820 --> 00:16:32.500
This whole village wants those 
two to love each other.

00:16:32.500 --> 00:16:33.740
Yeah.

00:16:34.210 --> 00:16:35.170
What?

00:16:35.170 --> 00:16:36.980
Aren't you happy, Gorone?

00:16:36.980 --> 00:16:39.520
Can you get the helmet, back there?

00:16:41.440 --> 00:16:45.120
Trying to make head movement easier 
always makes the neck more vulnerable.

00:16:45.680 --> 00:16:47.440
The thing on this face?

00:16:47.440 --> 00:16:48.630
That's it.

00:16:49.310 --> 00:16:50.070
Hey...

00:16:50.730 --> 00:16:52.530
Aren't you happy?

00:16:52.530 --> 00:16:56.460
You haven't forgotten our duty, right?

00:16:56.460 --> 00:16:57.780
We're...

00:16:57.780 --> 00:17:01.240
We're responsible for watching 
over them as they grow.

00:17:01.240 --> 00:17:01.790
Yeah.

00:17:02.100 --> 00:17:04.080
It sounds great,

00:17:04.080 --> 00:17:08.700
but you're basically trying to bring the 
two together, no matter what, right?

00:17:08.700 --> 00:17:11.980
Why do you have to say it like that?

00:17:11.980 --> 00:17:14.050
You don't like it?

00:17:17.070 --> 00:17:18.010
Here.

00:17:18.010 --> 00:17:19.050
Thanks.

00:17:25.850 --> 00:17:29.230
<b>Land of Tootoumi 
Ooi River</b>

00:17:40.060 --> 00:17:41.430
Where are the carriers?

00:17:41.430 --> 00:17:43.420
Where are the carriers
to take us across the river?

00:17:43.420 --> 00:17:45.830
I think they've already gone home.

00:17:45.830 --> 00:17:47.160
Recall them!

00:17:47.160 --> 00:17:48.830
I don't care how much you have to pay them!

00:17:49.140 --> 00:17:54.340
Even with their help, you won't be 
able to cross in this rain...

00:17:54.340 --> 00:17:55.860
Fool.

00:17:55.860 --> 00:17:57.470
Do you know who I am?!

00:17:57.890 --> 00:18:00.220
I am the Dainagon of Suruga!

00:18:02.700 --> 00:18:04.730
Do something! Do something!

00:18:04.730 --> 00:18:06.980
I know! A ship! Is there a ship?

00:18:08.500 --> 00:18:10.730
My lord... Stop!

00:18:14.420 --> 00:18:15.240
Halt!

00:18:15.240 --> 00:18:16.450
I found one.

00:18:20.190 --> 00:18:22.180
Praise be to Hachiman.

00:18:22.180 --> 00:18:26.360
Now, I can reach my mother!

00:18:26.360 --> 00:18:27.000
My lord...

00:18:27.660 --> 00:18:31.000
You don't plan to cross in this boat, do you?

00:18:31.360 --> 00:18:32.710
Of course!

00:18:32.710 --> 00:18:33.560
Hurry!

00:18:33.560 --> 00:18:36.760
Does anyone here know how 
to pilot a boat? Do you?

00:18:39.480 --> 00:18:42.010
Cowards...

00:18:42.010 --> 00:18:43.890
Then, I'll take it across!

00:18:44.680 --> 00:18:47.220
Men, push it into the river.

00:18:47.220 --> 00:18:49.670
Wait, my lord! Just wait—

00:18:52.110 --> 00:18:53.270
What's wrong?

00:18:57.030 --> 00:18:59.390
Attackers! Draw your swords!

00:19:10.530 --> 00:19:13.290
I ask, with the greatest respect,

00:19:14.450 --> 00:19:19.050
are you the Dainagon of Suruga?

00:19:19.230 --> 00:19:22.230
You would dare ask me a question?

00:19:22.750 --> 00:19:25.930
Who are you? Tell me your name!

00:19:26.380 --> 00:19:28.100
Your forgiveness...

00:19:28.100 --> 00:19:35.940
We men of low birth have no 
names worthy of giving you.

00:19:35.940 --> 00:19:37.440
What?

00:19:37.440 --> 00:19:39.690
Allow me to give you some advice.

00:19:39.690 --> 00:19:45.950
Suruga-sama, attempting to take 
that boat across the river is...

00:19:46.540 --> 00:19:51.460
Yes, like a dog trying to catch a rat.

00:19:51.710 --> 00:19:53.710
You would call me a dog?

00:19:54.120 --> 00:19:58.210
It was simply an example.

00:19:58.450 --> 00:19:59.670
Scum!

00:20:10.750 --> 00:20:16.730
"That blade should have sliced through him..."

00:20:17.310 --> 00:20:20.380
Is that what you just thought?

00:20:20.380 --> 00:20:23.910
Indeed, I should have been slain...

00:20:34.460 --> 00:20:36.690
Wh-Who are you?

00:20:38.220 --> 00:20:40.350
Do not worry.

00:20:40.350 --> 00:20:44.750
This is not due to any lack of skill 
you have with the blade.

00:20:45.060 --> 00:20:53.710
Even the greatest master of the 
sword cannot touch my skin...

00:20:54.020 --> 00:20:59.060
The blade naturally avoids my body.

00:20:59.060 --> 00:21:02.780
That's just how my body is.

00:21:02.980 --> 00:21:06.780
I call it the ninja technique "Ukigumo," 
the Floating Cloud.

00:21:06.780 --> 00:21:09.880
Then, you're a ninja?

00:21:09.880 --> 00:21:10.970
Indeed.

00:21:11.850 --> 00:21:15.790
But not an impressive one.

00:21:26.320 --> 00:21:30.850
Below average, at best.

00:21:33.530 --> 00:21:34.600
Kazuma!

00:21:38.230 --> 00:21:42.230
The Five Treasures of Kouga 
have come to serve you.

00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:27.010
<b><i>Preview</i></b>

00:23:26.100 --> 00:23:29.510
The leader of the Five Treasures 
of Kouga, Kouga Hachirou.

00:23:29.920 --> 00:23:33.070
The leader of the Five
Flowers of Iga, Iga Hibiki.

00:23:33.830 --> 00:23:36.800
The leaders of those who lurk in shadows.

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:38.020
<b><i>The Five Treasures Have Arrived</i></b>

00:23:36.800 --> 00:23:39.020
And an innocent brother and sister.
